      157.15,
      166.97,
      353.37,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "2Saweera Foundation (Incorporation)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      202.73,
      397.19,
      259.79
    ],
    "text": "(b)to conduct specific skills development programmesand workshops for school leavers and employedyouths with a view to enhancing leadership skillsand personality development in young men andwomen;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      271.25,
      397.18,
      305.39
    ],
    "text": "(c)to supply sanitary facilities, water and otherinfrastructure to households of people living inpoverty.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      316.85,
      397.21,
      373.79
    ],
    "text": "(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Body corporate shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      385.25,
      397.2,
      442.19
    ],
    "text": "4.The objects of the body corporate shall be carriedout in such manner so as not to create any conflict betweenthe work of the Body corporate and any work being carriedout simultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or any Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      499.25,
      397.2,
      556.19
    ],
    "text": "5. (1) Subject to the provisions of this Act Managementof the affairs of the body corporate shall be carried out by aBoard of Management (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Board\u201d)consisting of such number of office bearers as may bespecified by the rules made under section 7.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      567.65,
      397.19,
      601.79
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of the Body corporate shall beappointed or elected within one year of the date ofcommencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      613.25,
      397.21,
      670.19
    ],
    "text": "(3) (a) Every office bearer of the Board including thepatrons and advisors, shall be appointed or elected for aperiod of three years and any such office bearer, patron oradvisor shall be eligible for re-appointment or re-electionafter lapse of the said period of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
