  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.9,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) In the event of a vacancy occurring due to the death,resignation, incapacity or removal from office of an officebearer, the Board shall having regard to the rules of theBody corporate, elect or appoint a person to fill such vacancy.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.89,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) The person elected or appointed under paragraph (b)shall hold office only for the unexpired portion of the termof office of the member whom he succeeds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      310.97,
      401.88,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "6.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Body corporate shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as necessaryor desirable for the promotion or any one of them, includingthe power\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      382.97,
      401.9,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "(a) to purchase, acquire, rent, construct, renovate andotherwise obtain lands or buildings which may berequired for the purpose of the Body corporate and todeal with or dispose of the same as may be deemedexpedient with a view to promoting the objects of theBody corporate;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      466.97,
      401.86,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) to raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donations,in cash or kind with or without security:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      191.85,
      502.97,
      401.88,
      562.31
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, the Board shall obtain the priorwritten approval of the Department of ExternalResources of the Ministry of the Minister assignedthe subject of Finance, in respect of all foreign grants,gifts or donations made to the Body corporate;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      175.29,
      574.97,
      401.89,
      622.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) to make, draw, accept, discount, endorse, negotiate,buy, sell and issue bills of exchange, cheques,promissory notes and other negotiable instrumentsand to open, operate and close accounts in any banks;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      634.97,
      401.88,
      670.67
    ],
