      336.65,
      397.17,
      372.11
    ],
    "text": "(g) to do all other things as are necessary or expedientfor the proper and effective carrying out the objectsof the Body corporate.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      385.01,
      397.21,
      444.71
    ],
    "text": "7.(1) It shall be lawful for the Body corporate, fromtime to time, at any general meeting and by the votes of notless than two thirds of the members present and voting, tomake rules, not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act orany other written law, for all or any of the following matters:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      457.61,
      397.16,
      493.07
    ],
    "text": "(a)the classification of membership, admission,withdrawal, expulsion or resignation of membersand fees payable by members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      505.97,
      397.19,
      553.67
    ],
