    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      614.93,
      397.19,
      674.15
    ],
    "text": "(d)the procedure to be followed at the summoningand holding of meetings of the Board, or anysub-committee thereof, notices and agenda of suchmeetings, the quorum and the conduct of businessthereat;",
