    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      469.01,
      388.42,
      480.35
    ],
    "text": "9.(1) The Body corporate shall have its own Fund.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      491.21,
      401.92,
      535.91
    ],
    "text": "(2) All moneys received by way of gift, bequest, donation,subscription, contribution, fees or grants for an account ofthe Body corporate shall be deposited in one or more Banksapproved by the Board to the credit of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
